sn55.26:22.1 starts: So conviction & virtue,
sn55.26:22.2 starts: confidence & Dhamma-vision
sn55.26:22.3 starts: should be cultivated by the intelligent,
sn55.26:22.4 starts: remembering the Buddhas’ teachings.
an3.39:12.1 starts: There’s now no way
an3.39:12.2 starts: I could partake of sensual pleasures.
an3.39:12.3 starts: Having followed the holy life,
an3.39:12.4 starts: I will not return.
an3.48:5.1 starts: Seeing the virtue of that virtuous one,
an3.48:5.2 starts: his liberality & good conduct,
an3.48:5.3 starts: those who are perceptive
an3.48:5.4 starts: follow suit.
